<p>Hey <%= @user.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<% if @message %>
  <%# Plain text from the admin: escaped, with its line breaks kept. %>
  <%= simple_format(h(@message), {}, sanitize: false) %>
<% end %>

<p>This is a reminder to keep a copy of your Dabble Me journal for yourself.</p>

<p><strong><%= link_to "Export your journal", @export_url %></strong></p>

<p>
  You'll be asked to sign in. Choose to export everything, and you'll get an email with a link to a ZIP file
  holding all of your entries and photos. It opens in any web browser and needs no account.
</p>

<p style="color: #777; font-size: 13px;">
  You're getting this because you have a journal at Dabble Me. It's a notice about your account, not a newsletter,
  so it's sent whatever your email settings are. Questions? Just reply.
</p>
